WEBVTT

41:04.447 --> 41:06.782
But I couldn't do it.

41:07.616 --> 41:12.288
Because all I could think was
what if I got her pregnant

41:12.413 --> 41:17.418
and she had a child,
another bastard named Snow?

41:21.964 --> 41:24.800
It's not a good life for a child.

41:24.925 --> 41:27.011
Ah, mmm.

41:29.805 --> 41:31.307
So...
